{"product_id":"rich-dad-classics-boxed-set-by-robert-t-kiyosaki","title":"Rich Dad Classics Boxed Set by Robert T. Kiyosaki","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"424\"\u003eMoney doesn’t come with instructions, but Robert T. Kiyosaki has spent decades changing the way people think about it. The Rich Dad Classics Boxed Set brings together his most influential works, packaged for anyone ready to take control of their financial future.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"798\"\u003eInside these books, you’ll discover why the rich think differently, how to escape the trap of working for money, and how to start making money work for you. Kiyosaki’s straightforward, eye-opening approach blends personal stories with practical advice, making complex ideas about investing, assets, and financial independence easy to understand and impossible to ignore.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"1087\"\u003eWhether you’re just starting your financial journey or looking to sharpen your money mindset, this set is a powerful toolkit for building wealth, breaking old habits, and creating freedom. It’s not just about getting rich—it’s about changing the way you see the world of money forever.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"1087\"\u003eAuthor: Robert T. Kiyosaki\u003cbr data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1205\"\u003eISBN: 9781612680156\u003cbr data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1227\"\u003eFormat: Paperback box set\u003cbr data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1255\"\u003ePages: \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45732494540953,"sku":"4RA9781612680156","price":60.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/85_661387_000__101__01.jpg?v=1758271448","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/rich-dad-classics-boxed-set-by-robert-t-kiyosaki","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}